    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVAL OR DEATH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a young scientist whose experiment turned into a disaster. When you wake up in the heart of a creepy forest, where every whisper of the wind hides a threat, you realize: there are no rules here. There is only hunger, fear, and shadows hungry for your flesh. You have nothing but intelligence and the will to live. But isn't that enough to challenge the forest itself?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424000/extras/ad4a7da46845ed0115ec1d920f4e002e.poster.avif?t=1740313443\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424000/extras/ad4a7da46845ed0115ec1d920f4e002e.webm?t=1740313443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424000/extras/ad4a7da46845ed0115ec1d920f4e002e.mp4?t=1740313443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WHAT AWAITS YOU:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an open world where every shadow is an enemy, and every find is a step towards salvation. Uncover the secrets of the anomalous forest, where even the air is saturated with threat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine, craft, and survive: Create unique tools, from axes that cut through the darkness to swords that absorb the power of defeated enemies. Each item is your weapon against madness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build or die: Build defensive fortresses, traps and barricades. The night does not forgive mistakes \u2014 only those who are ready for the siege will survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight the horror: The war against monsters is not for the sake of glory \u2014 their flesh will become food, their bones \u2014 a resource, their fear \u2014 your weapon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunger is your main enemy: Look for food, experiment with recipes, but remember \u2014 even berries can drive you crazy in this forest.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424000/extras/15cb8e444701b29896f33d7cddebe77e.poster.avif?t=1740313443\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424000/extras/15cb8e444701b29896f33d7cddebe77e.webm?t=1740313443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424000/extras/15cb8e444701b29896f33d7cddebe77e.mp4?t=1740313443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game controls are simple and intuitive. You control the character using the keys W, A, S, D. You can rotate the camera using the keys Q and E. You can open the inventory and the crafting menu using the Tab key. You can attack or cut down trees using the left mouse button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An open world with procedurally generated hazards;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep crafting with lots of combinations;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic enemy and weather system;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The eerie atmosphere of the forest;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A soundtrack that will give you goosebumps overshadowing your hunger.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to take on the challenge and survive in Horrors Glade? Then go ahead, into the dark forest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424000/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.poster.avif?t=1740313443\" width=736 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424000/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.webm?t=1740313443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424000/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.mp4?t=1740313443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add the game to your wish list so that you don't miss the release of the full version of the game.</p>",
