, into the dark forest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424000/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.poster.avif?t=1740313443\" width=736 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424000/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.webm?t=1740313443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3424000/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.mp4?t=1740313443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add the game to your wish list so that you don't miss the release of the full version of the game.</p>",
